{
  "_id": "qjeb0VfLAdoWYkXE",
  "name": "Tentacle Rays",
  "type": "feature",
  "img": "icons/magic/unholy/beam-impact-green.webp",
  "system": {
    "featureForm": "action",
    "description": "<p><strong>Mark a Stress</strong> to attack a target within Far range. On a success, roll a <strong>d8</strong> for a random beam attack or <strong>spend a Fear</strong> to choose instead:</p><ol><li><p><strong>Beguile.</strong> The @Lookup[@name] Beguiles the target. While Beguiled, the target sees the @Lookup[@name] as a friend and can't attack it. Additionally, when a PC rolls with Fear, a Beguiled PC must mark a Stress or attack a target chosen by the @Lookup[@name]. A Beguiled PC must succeed on an Instinct Roll (16) to clear the condition.</p></li><li><p><strong>Corrode.</strong> The target takes <strong>2d8</strong> magic damage and must mark an Armor Slot without receiving its benefits (they can still use armor to reduce the damage). If they can't, double the damage.</p></li><li><p><strong>Doom.</strong> The target must mark all HP, but they can <strong>spend any number of Hope</strong> to reduce the number of HP marked this way by an equal amount.</p></li><li><p><strong>Hypnosis.</strong> The target falls into a Deep Trance and can't act except to try to wake up. This condition lasts until the target takes damage or wakes up with a successful Presence Roll (16).</p></li><li><p><strong>Paralyze.</strong> The target freezes in place, becoming <em>Vulnerable</em> and <em>Restrained</em> until they mark 2 Stress.</p></li><li><p><strong>Sear.</strong> The target takes <strong>2d8</strong> direct magic damage.</p></li><li><p><strong>Scare.</strong> The target is Scared. While Scared, the target can't take actions other than fleeing the battle or trying to shake off their terror. Additionally, the target must mark a Stress whenever you <strong>spend a Fear</strong>. The target can clear the condition with a successful Presence Roll (16).</p></li><li><p><strong>Slow.</strong> The target becomes <em>Vulnerable</em> and must mark a Stress to move until they <strong>spend 2 Hope</strong>.</p></li></ol>",
